 "title": "McHenry County, North Dakota - Home",
 "text": "McHenry County, North Dakota - Home\nSkip to main content\nMcHenry County, North Dakota - Home\nToggle navigation\nHome\nAbout\nDepartments\nAuditor\nCommission\nDistrict Court\nEmergency Management/911\nNDSU Extension\nPublic Health\nRecorder\nRoad Department\nSheriff's Department\nNorth Prairie Human Services\nState's Attorney\nSuperintendent of Schools\nTax Equalization\nTreasurer\nVeterans Service Office\nBoards\nCounty Planning & Zoning Commission\nPark Board\nWater Resource Board\nWeed Control Board\nTownship Boards\nLinks\nDownloads\nContact\nCounty load restrictions will be placed on all roads in McHenry County, effective March 17, 2025.\nMcHenry County, ND\n2024 Fire Emergency and Burn Restrictions\nView Details\nSeeking public input on Zoning Ordinance Update\nCLICK HERE FOR MORE INFORMATION\n1 2 3 4\nHow Do I?\nPay Property Taxes\nFind Fire Index Rating\nCounty Load Restriction Map\nObtain Birth Or Death Records\nRecord A Document\nLearn About Veteran Services\nGet A Driver's License\nState Load Restrictions\nPurchase Foreclosed property\nMore Links\nNews\n03/09/2026\nPublic Input Meeting on Updated Floodplain Ordinance\n12/30/2025\nAll County Offices Closed on January 1\n11/12/2025\nPublic Input on Zoning Ordinance Update\n09/05/2025\nBudget Hearing Notices\n03/04/2024\nMulti-Hazard Mitigation Plan Draft\nMore News\nUpcoming Events\nOct\n22\nCounty Planning & Zoning Board\nNov\n06\nCounty Commission Meeting\nNov\n17\nCounty Commission Meeting\nAll Events\nWelcome to McHenry County\nMcHenry County is a thriving, growing county with wealth in agriculture, cattle, natural resources, and tourism attractions such as some of the best hunting, fishing, and birding opportunities in the state.\nOur mission is to help communties and new and existing businesses grow through economic development incentives. Our focus includes additional diversification of the agriculture industry, expansion of the use of our natural resources in the energy sector, and working with partners in our region and state to promote and expand our tourism as well as to maintain the rich quality of life we have in our county, small towns, and farming communities.\nQuick Links\nPlaceholder\nPay Property Taxes\nView Commissioner Meeting Proceedings\nObtain Birth Or Death Records\nObtain A Marriage License\nPlaceholder\nRecord A Document\nGet A Driver's License\nCounty Load Restriction Map\nState Load Restrictions\nLearn About Veteran Services\nThe Weather Network -->\nMcHenry County\n407 Main Street S. Room 201\nTowner, ND 58788\nPhone:\nPhone:\nFax:\nMobile:\nPrivacy Policy\n© McHenry County, North Dakota",
